		"description": "<p>1 Action, Burst: 3. Spend a Fury Die to unleash a blood freezing howl. Enemies in the area must make a WIL save or be Frightened of you, 1 turn. Whenever you attack a target Frightened of you, two of your Fury Die are always their max value.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using it targets every enemy in Burst 3 when you have no targets, and expends your lowest Fury Die (Undo card; with none left you are asked first). Each target rolls the WIL save from the card; a failed save makes it Frightened.</em></p><p><em>[A] Your attacks against a Frightened target count two of your Fury Dice at their max value.</em></p><p><em>[M] Remove Frightened after 1 turn. \"Frightened of you\" is assumed for any Frightened target.</em></p>",
